       <h1>India Ranks 7th Globally in Hacking Impacts, Microsoft Report Reveals</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cybersecurity</span> <span>#India</span> <span>#Microsoft</span> <span>#Hacking</span></div>
       <p>India has been identified as ranking 7th globally in customer hacking impacts, according to the Microsoft Digital Defense Report 2026. This position highlights the country's significant exposure to cyber threats.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-06/india-ranks-7th-globally-in-hacking-impacts-microsoft-report.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The annual report from Microsoft provides a comprehensive overview of the global cybersecurity landscape. It details the various forms of digital attacks and their effects on customers worldwide.</p><p>The ranking underscores the ongoing challenges faced by Indian customers in maintaining digital security, as reported by The Times of India.</p><p>What to watch: Future cybersecurity measures and their impact on India's ranking.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately reflects the source summary provided.</p>
