       <h1>Kieran Culkin Expresses Desire to Continue Voicing Devil on 'Family Guy'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kieran Culkin has expressed interest in reprising his role as the Devil on the animated series &quot;Family Guy&quot; for the foreseeable future. Following a recent guest appearance, Culkin reportedly enjoyed the experience enough to insist on returning to the character if the show's creative team decides to revisit the role.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-06/kieran-culkin-expresses-desire-to-continue-voicing-devil-on-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Culkin was described as being highly collaborative and enthusiastic during his initial recording sessions. The actor's willingness to engage with the material has solidified his desire to remain part of the show's recurring cast as the Devil, should future opportunities arise within the production.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate, concise, and captures the essence of the source report.</p>
