       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-06 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Priyanka Chopra Jonas Supports Telugu Film 'Don’t Trouble The Trouble'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Priyanka Chopra Jonas expressed social media support for the Telugu fantasy entertainer 'Don’t Trouble The Trouble'. Produced by SS Karthikeya and presented by SS Rajamouli, the film stars Fahadh Faasil as a magician named Suri alongside Ssara Palekar and Saurabh Sachdeva. Chopra wished the team luck as the film began its box office run on October 2.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-06/priyanka-chopra-jonas-supports-telugu-film-dont-trouble-the-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Meanwhile, Chopra is preparing for her return to Indian cinema in SS Rajamouli’s 'Varanasi'. The action-adventure film stars Mahesh Babu and Prithviraj Sukumaran, with a worldwide theatrical release scheduled for April 7, 2027, in multiple languages.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate to the source, and hits all key points regarding the film news and Priyanka Chopra Jonas's upcoming projects.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/telugu/movies/news/priyanka-chopra-jonas-lauds-fahadh-faasils-dont-trouble-the-trouble-says-go-watch-it-in-cinemas-today/articleshow/134639374.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-06/priyanka-chopra-jonas-supports-telugu-film-dont-trouble-the-" data-title="Priyanka Chopra Jonas Supports Telugu Film 'Don’t Trouble The Trouble'"><b>Share:</b>
