       <h1>Sara Gurpal Clashes With Shehzad Poonawalla After Injury in Rise and Fall 2 Task</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Contestant Sara Gurpal sustained a forehead injury during a high-intensity gunpowder collection task on the reality show Rise and Fall 2. Despite the injury, which occurred when her protective helmet caused skin friction, Gurpal continued to compete until the challenge concluded.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-06/sara-gurpal-clashes-with-shehzad-poonawalla-after-injury-in-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the Workers' loss, Gurpal confronted Shehzad Poonawalla and the Penthouse contestants, labeling the verdict biased. She expressed frustration over the lack of empathy shown by opposing team members, who had witnessed her physical commitment during the task. The incident has further escalated tensions between the two competing groups on the program.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate and captures the key details of the reality show conflict.</p>
