       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-06 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>T-Series releases Shayad from Main Na Raha Mera</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>T-Series has released the romantic track 'Shayad' from the film Main Na Raha Mera, featuring actors Adhyayan Suman and Divita Rai. The song is composed by Rahul Nair with lyrics by Dev Pandey and vocals by Rekha Bhardwaj, who provides an emotional, intimate quality to the composition.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-06/t-series-releases-shayad-from-main-na-raha-mera.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Amit Kasaria and produced by Dharmesh Sangani, the project explores themes of vulnerability and unspoken relationship emotions. The music video is available on the T-Series YouTube channel, while the audio has been released across all major streaming platforms to accompany the film's promotional rollout.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Faithfully reports the song release and production credits provided in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
